{"video":"H_aB7eX5GqI","lines":[{"t":[0,2.2],"en":"-All right. Ready?"},{"t":[2.2,3.4],"en":"Come on, guys."},{"t":[3.4,5.7],"en":"Hurley Worm gets the worm."},{"t":[5.7,8],"en":"-Another worm? Like, are they friends?"},{"t":[8,9.7],"en":"-This early bird gets the worm."},{"t":[9.7,10.8],"en":"-Okay."},{"t":[10.8,13.5],"en":"-Pam, would you smell my breath?"},{"t":[13.5,14.5],"en":"-No. -No."},{"t":[14.5,15.5],"en":"-Let me smell."},{"t":[20.4,21.5],"en":"-Good, not great."},{"t":[21.5,23],"en":"-Michael, you go to parties all the time."},{"t":[23,24.2],"en":"Why is tonight so special?"},{"t":[24.2,27.9],"en":"Well, tonight is so special because my boss's boss's boss,"},{"t":[27.9,31],"en":"the CFO, not his initials, common mistake,"},{"t":[31,34.2],"en":"is having a little shindig for all the managers in the company,"},{"t":[34.2,38],"en":"and Jan and I are going as a couple for the first time,"},{"t":[38,41.2],"en":"so it's kind of our coming-out party, really,"},{"t":[41.2,43.8],"en":"and that is why tonight is so special."},{"t":[43.8,46],"en":"-Thanks for inviting me along."},{"t":[46,48.8],"en":"-Oh, sure. I really didn't give it any thought."},{"t":[48.8,50.8],"en":"Wait, should you be going?"},{"t":[52.8,54.4],"en":"Hello, you!"},{"t":[54.4,56],"en":"-Michael? -Hey, Buttercup."},{"t":[56,57.1],"en":"-Hi. -I am on my way."},{"t":[57.1,58.5],"en":"She'll be there in about 15."},{"t":[58.5,60.1],"en":"-Wait, let me blow this party off."},{"t":[60.1,61.1],"en":"-That's what she said."},{"t":[61.1,62.2],"en":"-Yeah."},{"t":[62.2,63.6],"en":"Am I on speakerphone?"},{"t":[63.6,65.4],"en":"-Ah, yes, you are."},{"t":[65.4,66.8],"en":"-Who is anybody else?"},{"t":[66.8,67.6],"en":"-Hello, Jan."},{"t":[67.6,68.6],"en":"-Hi, Dwight."},{"t":[68.6,70.6],"en":"Okay, Michael, take me off speakerphone."},{"t":[70.6,72],"en":"-No problem."},{"t":[74,76.8],"en":"-Okay, let's just go to a motel and just, like,"},{"t":[76.8,80.5],"en":"rip into each other like we did on that black sand beach in Jamaica."},{"t":[80.5,84.8],"en":"-Okay, Jan, Jan, this party is actually a very big step for us."},{"t":[84.8,87.2],"en":"-So I-- -Still on speaker?"},{"t":[87.2,90],"en":"-Um, I-- I don't know."},{"t":[90,91.3],"en":"-The camera's there?"},{"t":[91.3,92.3],"en":"-Maybe."},{"t":[92.3,94.3],"en":"-Cool. I'll see you soon."},{"t":[94.3,95.7],"en":"-Okay. -Talk to you later, Jan."},{"t":[95.7,97.5],"en":"-All right, bye."},{"t":[97.5,98.7],"en":"-What you looking for?"},{"t":[98.7,99.9],"en":"Did you bring Dip?"},{"t":[99.9,102.2],"en":"-I'm sure that it's catered."},{"t":[102.2,104.6],"en":"I need you to sign these, Michael."},{"t":[104.6,106.8],"en":"It's a waiver of some of your rights."},{"t":[106.8,108.4],"en":"You should read it carefully."},{"t":[108.4,110.8],"en":"It releases the company in the event that our relationship,"},{"t":[110.8,113.7],"en":"in your opinion or in reality, interferes with work."},{"t":[113.7,117.7],"en":"You get a copy, I get a copy, and a third copy goes to HR."},{"t":[117.7,120.6],"en":"-Awesome. I'm gonna frame mine."},{"t":[120.6,121.9],"en":"I could frame yours, too."},{"t":[121.9,123.9],"en":"-You realize this is-- this is a legal document"},{"t":[123.9,126.2],"en":"that says you can't sue the company?"},{"t":[126.2,129.6],"en":"-Over our love."},{"t":[129.6,132.6],"en":"-I've never told you that I love you."},{"t":[132.6,134.8],"en":"-You don't have to, Jan."},{"t":[134.8,137.4],"en":"-This contract says it all."},{"t":[137.4,139],"en":"-I am taking a calculated risk."},{"t":[139,140.2],"en":"What's the upside?"},{"t":[140.2,142.6],"en":"I overcome my nausea, fall deeply in love,"},{"t":[142.6,145.3],"en":"babies, normalcy, no more self-loathing."},{"t":[145.3,149.5],"en":"Downside, I, uh, date Michael Scott publicly"},{"t":[149.5,152.5],"en":"and collapse in on myself like a dying star."},{"t":[154.7,156.8],"en":"-What's this over the eye?"},{"t":[156.8,157.8],"en":"-A heart."},{"t":[159.7,164.4],"en":"-Why is this so hard?"},{"t":[164.4,166.4],"en":"-That's what she said."},{"t":[166.4,169],"en":"Oh, my God, what am I saying?"},{"t":[169,170.6],"en":"-I love this woman!"},{"t":[170.6,172.1],"en":"-Oh, my God."},{"t":[172.1,173.4],"en":"Michael, please, Michael."}]}
